            "details": "{\n  \"actual_scientific_reviewer\": \"Codex /root/skeptical_review (worker01; AI reviewer)\",\n  \"original_primary_author\": \"Codex /root/issue_context (worker01)\",\n  \"current_material_scope\": \"CHEBI:132766 remains the trisodium material, not the disodium stock or an arbitrary sodium stoichiometry. The imperative wording is quoted historical curation context, not a new instruction executed by this review.\",\n  \"comment_scope_limit\": \"The stock solvent and complete recipe remain unknown. No final-volume, role, dose, hydrate or occurrence-routing claim is added; the generic sodium-name token is retained only in its existing trisodium-owner sense.\",\n  \"complete_recommended_row\": {\n    \"comment\": \"Separate the 0.5 M disodium stock from trisodium nitrilotriacetate. Source occurrence rows explicitly name one of each. Restore the trisodium substance as its own record, carrying its chemistry and valid synonyms; withdraw those synonyms on the stock. The stock is a local preparation with a named disodium solute, no pure-substance formula or CAS. Solvent and complete recipe are not established. Evidence: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:132766 ; https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK519184/ ; ../CultureMech/output/ingredient_occurrences.tsv\",\n    \"confidence\": \"0.99\",\n    \"mapping_date\": \"2026-11-08\",\n    \"mapping_justification\": \"semapv:LexicalMatching\",\n    \"object_id\": \"CHEBI:132766\",\n    \"object_label\": \"sodium nitrilotriacetate\",\n    \"object_source\": \"obo:chebi.owl\",\n    \"other\": \"N,N-Bis(carboxymethyl)glycine, trisodium salt|NTA Trisodium salt|Nitrilotriacetic acid sodium salt|Trisodium N,N-bis(carboxymethyl)glycinate|Trisodium NTA|Trisodium aminotriacetate|Trisodium nitrilotriacetate|trisodium 2,2',2''-nitrilotriacetate|Na3-NTA|CAS:5064-31-3\",\n    \"predicate_id\": \"skos:exactMatch\",\n    \"source\": \"MIM:https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:132766|MIM:curator=codex_worker09_source_review|