              "notes": "#1382: released three-star ChEBI S-adenosyl-L-homocysteine explicitly defines the L-homocysteine derivative and records CAS 979-92-0. Its exact S-(5'-adenosyl)-L-homocysteine synonym and stereochemical structure match the named source/catalog material. Official API capture SHA256 c2b512c1babb3435fa548d704aae973545a3805bd333527712fa68f11f881c82. No role or optional structure/property bundle is imported.",
