            },
            {
              "evidence_type": "CURATOR_JUDGMENT",
              "notes": "#1382: the original row explicitly records Company Sigma, CatalogNumber A9384 and S-(5′-Adenosyl)-L-homocysteine. The inspected official A9384 sheet gives that L material and CAS 979-92-0, corroborating the ontology. Supplier text capture SHA256 aa7d3fae930a6962f6464939d71cd21e6abb128a2cfeb6c29d2b24cabea27bdb. L configuration is supported by the explicit source synonym/catalog; S- is a sulfur locant, not stereochemical evidence. No actual purchased lot, purity, hydrate, salt, solution concentration, occurrence or source-binding approval is inferred. All existing release/source/role holds remain.",
